// The rock library: a Rock template (boulders and slabs of granite, sandstone or forest stone,
// with strata, joints, flatness, displacement and moss as props), the RockScree and RockCluster
// templates (scree piles and outcrops of several rocks with scree around them) and the presets,
// all built from mesh graph nodes (box.mesh), with triplanar textures from texture graphs and a
// moss TextureLayer.
//
// A scene includes this, then places the rocks, such as rocks.flecs. The Scene needs
// texture_layers and triplanar.
include materials
include rock
include scree
include presets
